|---|---|---|---|---|
| **A. Status quo** | nothing | every requirement | No item ever completes. All work stays pending at implementation, kept for later. | — (it is the current state) |
| **B. One lab authors each item** (plan, code and revisions), as a policy decision | Worker and planner choice: the planner must come from the implementer's lab, or the reverse | three-lab panel; full co… (19801 chars, truncated)

